# A fence which encircles a large area, or a whole estate, within one enclosure. <!--"ring fence" more common for noun?-->

===Verb===
{{en-verb|ringfenc}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} to [[guarantee]] the [[safety]] of [[fund]]s or [[investment]]. In particular, to ensure some degree of distinction for [[monies]], that may provide [[immunity]] against [[untoward]] [[financial]] [[claim]]s.
# {{lb|en|transitive}} to [[specify]] that funds may only be used for a [[specific]] [[purpose]], especially [[government]] funds

